        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: None\n- Organizations: Cheiron Studios\n- Places: Stockholm, Sweden\n- Projects: Earthquake Visions\n- Concepts: Glam metal, funk metal\n- Topics: It's Alive (band)\n\nFacts:\n- It's Alive was a Swedish glam-style funk metal band formed in Stockholm in 1985.\n- Glam metal is a subgenre of heavy metal with pop-influenced hooks and guitar riffs, and it borrows from 1970s glam rock fashion.\n- Earthquake Visions is the album that It's Alive recorded for Cheiron Studios in 1994.",
